aruto-inspired multiplayer PvP VR game! Battle with up to 4 players as you walk on walls, use kunai, teleport, and rasengan to outplay your opponents! Many content updates planned based on community feedback."}]}, "developer_name": "Neo Zhou", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://neozhou777.wixsite.com/rasenganrush/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Neo Zhou", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://neozhou777.wixsite.com/rasenganrush", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "27113615221620386"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "558742480090587"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1069201804881215"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "558742480090587"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1732402980, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "558742480090587"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "39847027248279056", "version": "5.3.1"}, "id": "794049176269983", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "39847027248279056"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795137859, "id": "39901260869522360", "version": "5.3.1", "version_code": 308, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "39847027248279056"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795050338, "id": "39877411788573935", "version": "5.3.1", "version_code": 307, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "39847027248279056"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795049372, "id": "39877138108601303", "version": "5.3.1", "version_code": 306, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "39847027248279056"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794049176269983"}]}, "change_log": "**5.3.1: Hotfix (11/17/26)**\n- Fixed grabbed player being able to get stuck in a wall\n- Fixed voice chat report system reaching max capacity on daily reports\n- Other small bug fixes", "created_date": 1794954751, "id": "39847027248279056", "version": "5.3.1", "version_code": 305, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "39847027248279056"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794049176269983"}]}, "change_log": "**5.3.0: Healing Jutsu, Grabbing, Flipping, Arm Hitboxes, New Cosmetics (11/16/26)**\n*Dev Note: The next big updates will be focused on defensive and mobility based jutsus. And shoutout to LYROID, ALOE MART, and Nero Studios for the hand crafted cosmetics they created for this update!*\n\n**New Jutsu: Healing Jutsu!**\n- Concentrate chakra in your hands to speed up the regeneration of cells, and restore the health of yourself or your allies on contact! \n- Healing requires a lot of chakra, especially if you use it on yourself, so use it wisely! \n- Check the tutorial for more info.\n\n**New Mechanic: Grabbing**\n- You can grab players by pressing the grip button near them.\n- You can throw players at large distances with super strength.\n- When you\u2019re grabbed, you can fight back or simply teleport out.\n\n**New Mechanic: Flipping**\n- If you hold up or down on the right stick in midair, you can do front and backflips.\n\n**New Mechanic: Head Damage**\n- If you make someone hit a surface on their head while moving too fast, they will take damage.\n- The head damage victim takes 1 heart per 4 m/s they hit the wall at, for a maximum of 6 hearts if they hit a surface with their head at 24 m/s.\n\n**New Attack: Izuna Drop**\n- Grab someone, then flip upside down and fall to the ground so their head hits the ground first.\n- If you successfully land this maneuver, you\u2019ll be rewarded with a 2x chakra overdrive bonus.\n\n**New Mechanic: Throwable Swirling Spiral**\n- If you create a swirling spiral, you can grab it with grip, and then throw it\n- When thrown, the swirling spiral dissipates in size and deals less damage and knockback the further it travels.\n\n**New Mechanic: Arm Blocking**\n- Most attacks that hit the arms instead of the body will do 50% reduced damage and 50% reduced knockback\n- Attacks that can be blocked: kunai, punches, chakra overdrive, fire blossom, water jet, unboosted lightning blade, swirling spiral, paper bomb\n- Attacks that can not be blocked: fireball, boosted lighting blade, earth spike, lightning storm\n\n**New Mechanic: Dynamic Barrier Closing**\n- Instead of just being based off how much time has passed, if a certain number of players have been eliminated, barrier closing will start earlier. \n- For example, in a 4 player lobby, if there\u2019s three players left, the barrier will close to the second barrier zone, and if there\u2019s two players left, it will close to the third barrier zone\n- This will reduce the time spectators wait for the round to end\n\n**Chakra Overdrive Adjustment**\n*Dev Note: Overdrive has proven to be easier to hit than I ever anticipated with its huge hitbox combined with high mobility. The buff was designed to only activate in rare situations, but it activates almost every round. To deal with this, I\u2019ve heavily nerfed the refill while buffing it everywhere else I can. *\n- Buff: Removed the old speed condition needed to land a chakra overdrive\n- Buff: Chakra overdrive knockback: 16m->32m\n- Nerf: Chakra overdrive refills 1 bar instead of your entire 7,8, or 9 bars\n\n**New Clothing Items from LYROID!**\n- Added new upper body clothing items: \u201cGi\u201d, \u201cHaori and Kimono\u201d, and \u201cWindbreaker\u201d\n- Added new lower body clothing item: \u201cHakama Pants\u201d\n- Added new shoes: \u201cWaraji Sandals\u201d\n\n**New Hair Options!**\n- Added \u201cWinged Twintails\u201d by Nero Studios\n- Added \u201cSpiky Sidetail\u201d by ALOE MART\n\n**Shop Price Adjustments**\n*Dev Note: Any players that own an item that was lower in price will have that amount refunded*\n- Drop Shoulder T-Shirt: 1000 coins -> 500 coins\n- Shorts: 1000 coins -> 500 coins\n- Leather Shoes: 1000 coins -> 500 coins\n- Kung Fu Shoes: 1000 coins -> 500 coins\n- Bob Cut: 1000 coins -> 500 coins\n- Sporty Hair: 1000 coins -> 500 coins\n- Two Block Cut: 1000 coins -> 500 coins\n- Face Mask: 1000 coins -> 500 coins\n\n**Quality of Life Changes**\n- Artist names are now displayed directly under the name of the item in the shop\n- Where you end up when teleporting to a kunai is more intuitive than before\n- Added new gameplay settings\n\n**Bug Fixes**\n- Fixed bug where you could charge lightning storm and phase through walls\n- Fixed a bug where you wouldn\u2019t take knockback if in the middle of wall transitioning", "created_date": 1794867418, "id": "39817951994519915", "version": "5.3.0", "version_code": 304, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}